{"id": "docs/index.html:html-82", "file": "docs/index.html", "location": "html-82", "text": "Tap an address to select it. What this actually pays for: the Apple Developer\n          membership that keeps the TestFlight build alive, a second band to get\n          WHOOP 5 support tested, and coffee.", "sha256": "e01a4224eee1571c785708e57499c785908b52e4f441876045af19f604bd444f", "line": 241}
{"id": "docs/index.html:html-83", "file": "docs/index.html", "location": "html-83", "text": "More →", "sha256": "40fcf02484345c9a0baef06e2ea8878451942374e652cbce17132e0023288f75", "line": 245}
{"id": "docs/index.html:html-84", "file": "docs/index.html", "location": "html-84", "text": "Nothing is gated behind paying, and nothing ever will be.", "sha256": "d9ff6576878a96a73024fed659aa151e20f93c9306748c7e5c6e0b905ee957e6", "line": 248}
{"id": "docs/index.html:html-85", "file": "docs/index.html", "location": "html-85", "text": "Bug reports from real bands are worth more than money — there’s only\n          one person’s physiology in the test data otherwise.", "sha256": "cf9ded9013546a9fcd5a2a32021e2aab2e2f0e77b7fd8240b2ebd2f483bfee3e", "line": 248}
